            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Yawe atampile ukulanda amashiwi kuli Hosea, Yawe amwebele ati, “Upa umwanakashi impulumushi ukafyalemo abana ba mu bupulumushi, pantu abantu bandi nababa impulumushi kabili nabansangukila, ine ne Yawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi nao Hosea epakuupa umwanakashi umo, ishina lyakwe ni Gomeri mwana Dibulaimu. Asuka aba na pabukulu, apapa no mwana umwaume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aeba Hosea ati, “Mwinike ishina lya Yesireli, pantu tapakokole ninshi ine nalimuna imfumu ya bena Israeli pa mulandu wa bupondo ubo Yehu wishi acitile kuli Yesireli. Ine nalaswa ndofye ubufumu bwa bena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali ilya ine nshita, ine ninshi napwisha amaka ya fita fya bena Israeli mwishika lya Yesireli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
