            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hosea 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Gomeri aimita apapa umwana na umbi, wena umwanakashi. Yawe aeba Hosea ati, “Mwinike ishina lya Lo Ruhama, emukutila munshilangulukilwa, pantu ine nomba nshakalangulukileko nakabili aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli, kabili nshakababeleleko uluse nakabili iyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Yuda bena nkabalangulukilako, ine ne Yawe Lesa wabo nkabapususha, lelo kwena pakubapususha ine nshakemye nkondo iyoo, nshakabomfye lupanga, nangufye amata ne mifwi, nangufye bakabalwe na babendelapo bene, lelo nkabapususha ku maka yandi ne mwine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Gomeri asumwine mwane Loruhama, nakabili aba pabukulu. Asuka apapa no mwana umwaume na umbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe nao aeba Hosea ati, “Mwinike ishina lya Lo-Ami, emukuti te bantu bandi, pantu mwe bena Israeli nomba tamuli bantu bandi iyoo, na ine wine nomba nshili Lesa wenu iyoo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
